title: "Security Engineering Lab"
abstract: >-
  A modular, Vagrant-provisioned laboratory for Active Directory security
  research, network segmentation, Kubernetes and DevSecOps workflows, Windows
  hardening validation, and an OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications training lab,
  built for isolated, authorized environments.
